  "question": {
    "text": "Speeds of two identical cars are $u$ and $4 u$ at the specific instant. The ratio of the respective distances in which the two cars are stopped from that instant is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "4pmiJ",
      "text": "\n1 : 1\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Lk5xn",
      "text": "\n1 : 4\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "lCXuT",
      "text": "\n1 : 8\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PEW3W",
      "text": "\n1 : 16",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Use $u^2=2$ as. a is same for both cases\n$$\n\\mathrm{s}_1=\\mathrm{u}^2 / 2 \\mathrm{a} ; \\mathrm{s}_2=16 \\mathrm{u}^2 / 2 \\mathrm{a}=16 \\mathrm{~s}_1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{s}_1: \\mathrm{s}_2=1: 16\n$$",
    "image": null
